Package: PLAenriched
Title: RNA-Based Detection of Platelet-Leukocyte Aggregates in scRNA-seq Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Aurelia", "Dersch", , "DEINE@MAIL", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Irem", "Kaciran", role = "aut"),
    person("Fabian", "Mathis", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Scores every cell for a platelet signature and a leukocyte
    activation signature and calls platelet-leukocyte aggregates (PLAs) with a
    global dual-gate Gaussian mixture model.
